  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pro-ARIDES: Agrifood Program for Integrated Resilience and Economic Development in the Sahel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pro-ARIDES aims to contribute to increased resilience, food security and incomes of agricultural and (agro-) pastoral households in the Sudano-Sahelian zone of Burkina Faso, Mali and Niger, through effective decentralized institutions and organizations for service delivery , natural resource and land management and local economic development.</narrative>
  </description>
